#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/language/customize/index.rst:44
msgid ""
"Floating-point ``NaN`` values in the input or either bound propagate to the "
"result. When ``min_val > max_val``, the result is ``max_val`` (unless an "
"operand is ``NaN``), matching ``torch.clamp``. Each operand is evaluated "
"once, and vector operands are clamped independently in each lane."
